+# RUNLOG
+
+- `cat go.mod Makefile README.md && find cmd internal scripts -type f` — 读取构建契约与仓库结构，确认 module 与验证入口
+- 读取 AGENTS.md、internal/httpapi/router.go、router_test.go、cmd/server/main.go — 读取 Profile 与既有 handler/测试约定
